# Keep the Cloud Build upload tiny: cloud/Dockerfile only needs the engine
# source (simulations/, minus build artifacts) and the cloud/ configs.
# Ignore everything, then re-include just those.
*
!simulations/
!simulations/**
!cloud/
!cloud/**

# ...but never the compiled Rust artifacts (rebuilt in-container) or caches.
simulations/target/
**/*.rs.bk
.git/
